  m_Text: 'This scene demonstrates the streaming of deferred components


    1.
    Make sure to Enable Lookup Cache in the Save Settings otherwise loading will
    take a very long time and the Editor will likely freeze for the loading duration


    2.
    Bump into the Cylinders


    3. Save & Load the Game


    4. Move & Stream
    into the last Component State'
